{"id":"n-20261027-ai75am","category":"travel","display_title":"Solo Ski Trip in France","display_title_he":"טיפוס סקי לבד בצרפת","short_summary":"A solo traveler joins a group ski trip in the French Alps with Friendship Travel, finding camaraderie, great slopes, and much-needed rest.","english_level":"C1","words":435,"reading_time":3,"image":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9a/VALSIAN.jpg/960px-VALSIAN.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","credit":"SoyCesarRosas · CC BY-SA 4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:VALSIAN.jpg"},"sources":[{"name":"The Guardian","domain":"theguardian.com","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/travel/2026/oct/26/group-skiing-trip-solo-travellers-les-deux-alpes-france-alps","title":"‘Meet my new après buddies!’: a joyous group skiing trip in Les Deux Alpes, France","published_at":"2026-10-26T07:00:24.000Z"}],"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:00:24.000Z","first_published_in_app_at":"2026-10-27T06:32:06.971Z","quality_score":9,"interest_score":8,"verification_status":"verified","content_status":"published","paragraphs":["Embarking on a holiday with a group of complete strangers can feel like a daunting leap into the unknown. Seeking a much-needed break from domestic exhaustion—specifically a relentless toddler waking up four times a night—one traveler opted for a week-long skiing excursion in the French resort of Les Deux Alpes. The trip was arranged by Friendship Travel, a specialist operator catering to solo travelers for more than two decades. The formula is straightforward: the company secures a chalet, fills it with solo travelers, and provides transportation, most meals, and group ski lessons.","Upon arriving at the comfortable chalet, the guest was greeted by low-key hosts and introduced to the other participants. The group comprised seventeen individuals—nine women and eight men—spanning an age range primarily between thirty-five and sixty-five, with our group resting at the top end of that range. Among them were seasoned solo travelers who had completed dozens of similar journeys, alongside first-timers looking to overcome years of hesitation or navigate personal life changes, such as putting life back together after a split or dealing with a non-skiing partner.","The daily routine quickly established a comfortable rhythm. Mornings began at the ski lockers before heading out to the slopes. Thanks to the resort's updated Jandri 3S cable car, skiers were whisked up to an altitude of 3,200 meters in just seventeen minutes, offering breathtaking views of the jagged peaks of the Écrins national park above broken clouds. Divided into ability groups, the participants navigated a mix of broad blue and red runs, finding safety and confidence in numbers while exploring the mountain.","Mining connections with new acquaintances proved to be a rewarding aspect of the journey. Afternoons transitioned seamlessly from skiing to vibrant après-ski gatherings on packed terraces with a DJ at venues like Skandal. Evenings brought shared three-course dinners and lively conversations, accompanied by the constant pinging of the chalet WhatsApp group organizing pub visits. Participants bonded over diverse life stories, ranging from past travels to unexpected shared interests, despite occasional moments of tedious small talk.","According to Colum McLornan, who founded Friendship Travel in 1999, the perception of solo travel has shifted dramatically over the decades. What was once viewed as unconventional or burdened by a social stigma is now celebrated. Travelers increasingly seek independence, flexibility, and personal growth, making solo holidays one of the fastest-growing segments in the travel industry.","Ultimately, the experiment proved a resounding success. Beyond the superb high-altitude skiing on the Glacier de Mont-de-Lans and helpful hosts, the trip delivered what was most desperately needed: uninterrupted sleep and the company of a brand-new ski gang."],"facts":[{"fact":"A solo traveler took a group skiing trip to Les Deux Alpes, France, organized by Friendship Travel.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"The group consisted of 17 strangers staying in a large ski chalet.","sources":[1]},{"fact":"Friendship Travel founder Colum McLornan noted that solo travel has shifted from carrying a stigma to becoming one of the fastest-growing industry segments.","sources":[1]}],"glossary":[{"text":"Embarking","lemma":"embark","pos":"verb","he":"להתחיל, לצאת ל","name":false},{"text":"holiday","lemma":"holiday","pos":"noun","he":"חופשה","name":false},{"text":"group","lemma":"group","pos":"noun","he":"קבוצה","name":false},{"text":"complete","lemma":"complete","pos":"adjective","he":"מוחלט, לגמרי","name":false},{"text":"strangers","lemma":"stranger","pos":"noun","he":"זרים","name":false},{"text":"daunting","lemma":"daunting","pos":"adjective","he":"מפחיד, מרתיע","name":false},{"text":"leap","lemma":"leap","pos":"noun","he":"קפיצה","name":false},{"text":"unknown","lemma":"unknown","pos":"noun","he":"הלא נודע","name":false},{"text":"Seeking","lemma":"seek","pos":"verb","he":"מחפש","name":false},{"text":"break","lemma":"break","pos":"noun","he":"הפסקה, הפוגה","name":false},{"text":"domestic","lemma":"domestic","pos":"adjective","he":"ביתי","name":false},{"text":"exhaustion","lemma":"exhaustion","pos":"noun","he":"תשישות","name":false},{"text":"relentless","lemma":"relentless","pos":"adjective","he":"בלתי פוסק","name":false},{"text":"toddler","lemma":"toddler","pos":"noun","he":"פעוט","name":false},{"text":"waking","lemma":"wake","pos":"verb","he":"מתעורר","name":false},{"text":"times","lemma":"time","pos":"noun","he":"פעמים","name":false},{"text":"night","lemma":"night","pos":"noun","he":"לילה","name":false},{"text":"traveler","lemma":"traveler","pos":"noun","he":"מטייל","name":false},{"text":"opted","lemma":"opt","pos":"verb","he":"בחר","name":false},{"text":"week-long","lemma":"week-long","pos":"adjective","he":"בן